        "slc_07fb9564e2b7741956b45047e9fda3b5a467fdb6cab81d0954383d1d6a643319"
      ],
      "text": "The frontend is a Next.js application using Tailwind CSS with a Supabase client and complete auth flows including login, signup, and password reset."
    },
